{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S09把“想在难受时有人陪”推进成“甚至愿意再受那些气”，增加了原文未必支持的心理判断，削弱了人物内心的开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的优势不只是重点加亮，而是观众能先抓住每段人物心理发生了什么变化，再通过较小的感受文字和按音乐时机出现的提示，逐步感受到变化是怎样发生的。尤其是“不再受气、怀念亲近、害怕孤单、决定继续生活”这些反复出现的心理线索，形成了清楚的前后关联，既能理解人物为什么矛盾，也能感受到矛盾内部细微的变化。X的左右分栏有一定的快速浏览优势，但右侧短词容易变成彼此独立的情绪标签，部分段落甚至需要观众自行拼接，Y整体更容易让普通观众在听音乐时同时获得叙事、理解和细腻的感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df387fca-df1e-4b6a-befd-103f27d48928", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005837550525Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:59:15.331809+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4679eef872572aa63a0dde738261384066a58af9b8d75190f0b11c4b47b9fbfd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f6